SUMMARY:Computers for Beginners 6: Use Gmail
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261005T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261005T150000
UID:6a95da92660e510bf440a103@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Learn to use Gmail\, Google’s free web-based email service.\
 nIn this sixth session you will:\nPractice basic email functions: send\, r
 ead\, reply\, forward\, delete email\, and attach files\nReview how spam a
 nd junk mail work\nUpon completion of this class students will have a basi
 c understanding of how to use email.\nInstructions on how to set up and ma
 nage your own free Gmail account are included in the handout.\nPrerequisit
 es: Basic keyboarding and mouse skills required.\nFormat: Hands-on with de
 monstrations\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on 
 this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libr
 aries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only 
 be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Ques
 tions about how the library handles your information can be directed to An
 swerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\,
  Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Brentwood\, Learning Centre\, 2nd floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a95da92660e510bf440a103
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Adult Afternoon Movie - The Roses (2025)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260929T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260929T160000
UID:6a3465fb3e640a440019fbc6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Life seems easy for picture-perfect couple Ivy (Olivia Colman)
  and Theo (Benedict Cumberbatch): successful careers\, great kids\, and a 
 loving marriage. But underneath the façade of the perfect family is a tin
 derbox of competition and resentments that's ignited when Theo's professio
 nal dreams come crashing down.\nR\, 105 minutes\n**Subtitles for the deaf 
 and hard of hearing when available (SDH).
LOCATION:Riverdale\, Program Room 1
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3465fb3e640a440019fbc6
