DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260925T120000
UID:6a84e5e4e90c830d873fd98c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Human connection has a profound impact on our health and happi
 ness\, especially in our increasingly disconnected post-pandemic world. Jo
 in GenWell to learn practical ways to enhance social health\, understand t
 he adverse effects of loneliness\, and discover the benefits of building m
 ore meaningful connections. Spend time with other participants after the p
 rograms and enjoy some light refreshments provided.\nRegistration is requi
 red.
LOCATION:St. James Town
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a84e5e4e90c830d873fd98c
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
