BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:NatureTO: Managing Invasive Plants Around Your Home
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261116T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261116T153000
UID:69c5555f1e64afd01e64d9b2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join City of Toronto Urban Forestry staff for a presentation o
 n invasive plants commonly found around homes in Toronto.\nLearn how to id
 entify these species\, understand their impact\, and effectively manage th
 em. You’ll also get tips on supporting local biodiversity through enhanc
 ing native habitats. Perfect for gardeners\, homeowners\, and anyone inter
 ested in urban ecology. All are welcome. No registration necessary.
LOCATION:Agincourt\, 1st Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69c5555f1e64afd01e64d9b2
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
