DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260924T190000
UID:6a6b845ba0b1bdf860d8db5a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Writers of all experience levels are welcome at the Richview W
 riters Circle. We will start off with a short writing prompt and then part
 icipants will have the opportunity to share their writing for feedback fro
 m the group.\nDrop in\n. No experience is required and all writing styles 
 and genres are welcome.
LOCATION:Richview\, Room A\, 2nd Floor
