DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261026T200000
UID:6a578bd771ef1362005245a9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us once a month on Monday to share your thoughts and enj
 oy a lively discussion with fellow book lovers.\nBring a recent book you y
 ou liked to recommend to other book lovers who read books and discuss them
  in Polish language.\nDrop-in program\, no registration required.
LOCATION:Brentwood\, Community Room\, 1st floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a578bd771ef1362005245a9
