DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260924T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260924T140000
UID:6a91d53060ccaf01c021beff@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Calling  ALL  Adults!!\nCome chat and make new friends in wa
 rm and welcoming environment.\nWe will be hosting plenty of fun activities
  such as arts and crafts\, Bingo and different techniques of painting.
LOCATION:Daniel G. Hill\, Meeting room
