DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261105T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261105T200000
UID:6a8ca2332656cb00467289c7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Riverdale Immigrant Women's Centre\, this worksho
 p is an introduction to long-term financial planning including retirement 
 savings and better understanding of federal income benefits\, such as\, Ca
 nada Pension Plan (CPP) and Old Age Security (OAS). Drop-in program\, firs
 t come\, first serve seating.
LOCATION:Mount Dennis\, Lower Level\, Room 2
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a8ca2332656cb00467289c7
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
