SUMMARY:Tea and Entertainment
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261002T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261002T160000
UID:6a77446c4523092f0035ac19@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy watching DVDs in the Library Auditorium.\nCoffee\, tea a
 nd cookies or snacks will be served after the film. Ingredient lists will 
 be available upon request.\nBig Cats: Landlords\nIn Botswana\, lions\, che
 etahs\, and leopards compete for the same land\, food\, and survival\, eac
 h raising their young under constant threat. With lions dominating and oth
 ers forced to adapt\, every hunt is a gamble—and one mistake can be fata
 l. Closed Captions.53 minutes. 2025.
