BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Seniors Fire Safety Presentation
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261014T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261014T150000
UID:6a95b09dbe148200298b61b2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Fire Services will be presenting a Fire Safety Present
 ation\, followed by Q&A for older adults and families. Topics covered incl
 ude:\nPreventing a fire from happening to you\nCauses of home fires\nPlace
 ment/need for smoke & CO alarms\nEliminating nuisance alarms\nEscape plann
 ing for special needs\nCalling for help (how/when/from where)\nFire safety
  in high-rise buildings
LOCATION:Bendale\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a95b09dbe148200298b61b2
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:La Scopa: Learn and Play a Traditional Italian Card Game
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260914T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260914T150000
UID:6a85ec1fbe14820029887e53@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Scopa (Italian: [ˈskoːpa]\; lit. 'broom') is a century old t
 raditional Italian card game\, involving memory\, skill\, strategy and lit
 tle bit of luck. It is easy to learn\, and a challenge to master. Bring yo
 ur friends or make new ones while playing this classic pass time.
LOCATION:Humber Summit\, Auditorium\, Lower level
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a85ec1fbe14820029887e53
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
