 uzzles\, colouring\, and tech help. You are welcome to bring your own devi
 ce or use our provided laptops during your visit.
LOCATION:New Toronto\, Program room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a8a027ebe14820029894e76
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
