DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260929T150000
UID:6a8851d4be1482002988faec@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Calling all older adults! Come join us at Morningside library 
 every month (on the last Tuesday of the month).\nEnjoy a variety of topics
 \, guest speakers\, lively conversation\, & fun activities!\nSeptember’s
  social will be fun games of BINGO! Feeling lucky? Play a game & you could
  win a prize!\nLight refreshments will be served! Drop in!
