DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260908T203000
UID:6a91d1a237716d0d1ad71681@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop we will cover the basics of operating a DSLR 
 camera (manual mode) as well as look at editing photos with Adobe lightroo
 m - one of the most convenient programs to get the best out of your photos
