DESCRIPTION:This compassionate workshop offers a   safe\, gentle\, and con
 fidential space for women to honor their feelings\,   release emotional pa
 in\, and find a sense of peace. As part of the library settlement partners
 hip this program is conducted   in both Mandarin and English.\nTo register
  contact Wen Chen at 647-388-3762 or email wchen@ccscan.ca
LOCATION:Agincourt\, Multipurpose Room\, 1st floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a7f1a74b20478002992d058
