DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261003T153000
UID:6a91c10f29a7dd0d6747531e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:​This introductory workshop is designed to help newcomers in
  Canada identify and manage their personal brand in alignment with their p
 rofessional goals. It covers key business branding elements and offers act
 ionable steps to enhance brand presence. Through interactive activities\, 
 participants will apply their learnings to develop both personal and busin
 ess brands\, while exploring marketing strategies and campaign elements su
 ited to their new environment.\nRegistration Required.\nThis program is pa
 rt of Small Business Month and the Newcomer Entrepreneurship Initiative.\n
 Information Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is c
 ollected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, se
 ctions 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for ev
