 hreats: malware\, phishing\, hacking\, etc.\nGain an understanding of the 
 limitations of these tools and habits.\nPrerequisites: Some computer exper
 ience required\; the ability to navigate app menus\, browsers\, and deskto
 p computing features is desirable.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe pe
 rsonal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library
